Sear your hatred into the mind of a target, dealing escalating Mind damage each turn over 5 turns. The victim will suffer [19, 26, 31, 35, 39 (TL1-5; MP 100)] damage on the first turn, slowly increasing up to [96, 129, 155, 177, 196 (TL1-5; MP 100)] damage on the last, dealing [287, 387, 464, 530, 588 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Mind damage in total. Re-applying the effect resets the damage escalation. The victim has a 25% chance of suffering Brainlock each turn from the unbearable pain.

The damage increases with your Mindpower.
